/6y3zli1mntzn1wz/3d16be45-484a-49c3-b1a9-eb6c9fd51182/7cc1cc30-3574-11f1-885a-a9439bac298a/file-6y3zli1mntzn1x0.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/6y3zli1mntzn1wz/3d16be45-484a-49c3-b1a9-eb6c9fd51182/7cc1cc30-3574-11f1-885a-a9439bac298a/file-6y3zli1mntzn1x0.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/6y3zli1mntzn1wz/3d16be45-484a-49c3-b1a9-eb6c9fd51182/7cc1cc30-3574-11f1-885a-a9439bac298a/file-6y3zli1mntzn1x0.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/6y3zli1mntzn1wz/3d16be45-484a-49c3-b1a9-eb6c9fd51182/7cc1cc30-3574-11f1-885a-a9439bac298a/file-6y3zli1mntzn1x0.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/6y3zli1mntzn1wz/3d16be45-484a-49c3-b1a9-eb6c9fd51182/7cc1cc30-3574-11f1-885a-a9439bac298a/file-6y3zli1mntzn1x0.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\">\n","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"<p>0.5</p>\n"},{"identifier":"B","content":"<p>1.5</p>\n"},{"identifier":"C","content":"<p>0</p>\n"},{"identifier":"D","content":"<p>2</p>"}],"correct_options":["A"],"explanation":"<p>In a DC circuit, at steady state a capacitor is fully charged and it acts as an open circuit i.e., no current flows through the branch containing the capacitor.</p>\n<p>The circuit simplifies to a single loop consisting of the 2 V battery, the <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.05ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.765ex\" height=\"1.643ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -704 1222 726\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"36\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-36\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"3A9\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3A9\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> resistor, and the <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.765ex\" height=\"1.593ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -704 1222 704\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"3A9\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3A9\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> resistor.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"JEE Main 2026 (Online) 5th April Evening Shift Physics - Capacitor Question 2 English Explanation\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/6y3zli1mo8qp1es/326a2d2b-eea9-416d-b0f0-dddb594a3797/43905240-3d91-11f1-a2f5-3791f5a1f877/file-6y3zli1mo8qp1et.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/6y3zli1mo8qp1es/326a2d2b-eea9-416d-b0f0-dddb594a3797/43905240-3d91-11f1-a2f5-3791f5a1f877/file-6y3zli1mo8qp1et.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;max-height:40vh;vertical-align:baseline\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/6y3zli1mo8qp1es/326a2d2b-eea9-416d-b0f0-dddb594a3797/43905240-3d91-11f1-a2f5-3791f5a1f877/file-6y3zli1mo8qp1et.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/6y3zli1mo8qp1es/326a2d2b-eea9-416d-b0f0-dddb594a3797/43905240-3d91-11f1-a2f5-3791f5a1f877/file-6y3zli1mo8qp1et.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/6y3zli1mo8qp1es/326a2d2b-eea9-416d-b0f0-dddb594a3797/43905240-3d91-11f1-a2f5-3791f5a1f877/file-6y3zli1mo8qp1et.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/6y3zli1mo8qp1es/326a2d2b-eea9-416d-b0f0-dddb594a3797/43905240-3d91-11f1-a2f5-3791f5a1f877/file-6y3zli1mo8qp1et.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/6y3zli1mo8qp1es/326a2d2b-eea9-416d-b0f0-dddb594a3797/43905240-3d91-11f1-a2f5-3791f5a1f877/file-6y3zli1mo8qp1et.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/6y3zli1mo8qp1es/326a2d2b-eea9-416d-b0f0-dddb594a3797/43905240-3d91-11f1-a2f5-3791f5a1f877/file-6y3zli1mo8qp1et.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<p>As both the resistors are in series,</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.72ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24.706ex\" height=\"2.313ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -704 10920.1 1022.2\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"52\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-52\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(769,-176.7) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">total\u00a0</text></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3642.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(4698.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"36\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-36\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(5198.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"3A9\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3A9\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(6142.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(7142.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(7642.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"3A9\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3A9\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(8642.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(9698.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"38\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-38\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(10198.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"3A9\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3A9\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>The steady-state current i flowing through this main loop is:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.29ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"25.118ex\" height=\"3.274ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -877 11102.3 1446.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"49\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-49\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(638.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(1694.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1144.4,394) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"56\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-56\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"52\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-52\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(769,-176.7) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">total\u00a0</text></g></g></g><rect width=\"2579.1\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4791.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(5847.2,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"38\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-38\"></use></g><rect width=\"553.6\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(6918.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(7974.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(9752.3,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">\u00a0</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(600,0)\"><use data-c=\"41\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-41\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>The capacitor branch is connected in parallel with the <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.765ex\" height=\"1.593ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -704 1222 704\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"3A9\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3A9\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> resistor. Therefore, the potential difference across it is equal to the potential difference across the <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.765ex\" height=\"1.593ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -704 1222 704\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"3A9\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3A9\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> resistor.</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.452ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"34.816ex\" height=\"2.149ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 15388.7 950\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"56\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-56\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(783,-150) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"42\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-42\"></use><use data-c=\"45\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-45\" transform=\"translate(708,0)\"></use></g></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2092.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href