h April Evening Shift","year":2026,"subject":"physics","chapter":"capacitor","chapterGroup":"electricity","type":"mcq","marks":4,"negMarks":1,"content":"<p>Under steady state condition the potential difference across the capacitor in the circuit is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.14ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.525ex\" height=\"0.084ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 25 2000 37\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"5F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"5F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"><use data-c=\"5F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1500,0)\"><use data-c=\"5F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5F\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> V.</p><img alt=\"JEE Main 2026 (Online) 5th April Evening Shift Physics - Capacitor Question 2 English\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/6y3zli1mntzn1wz/3d16be45-484a-49c3-b1a9-eb6c9fd51182/7cc1cc30-3574-11f1-885a-a9439bac298a/file-6y3zli1mntzn1x0.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/6y3zli1mntzn1wz/3d16be45-484a-49c3-b1a9-eb6c9fd51182/7cc1cc30-3574-11f1-885a-a9439bac298a/file-6y3zli1mntzn1x0.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;max-height:40vh;vertical-align:baseline\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/6y3zli1mntzn1wz/3d16be45-484a-49c3-b1a9-eb6c9fd51182/7cc1cc30-3574-11f1-885a-a9439bac298a/file-6y3zli1mntzn1x0.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/6y3zli1mntzn1wz/3d16be45-484a-49c3-b1a9-eb6c9fd51182/7cc1cc30-35